  "question": {
    "text": "A power transmission line feeds input power at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2400</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> to a step-down transformer and which delivers power at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>240</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> with its primary windings having <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5000</mn></math> turns.&nbsp;If the current in the primary coil of the transformer is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>&nbsp;and its efficiency is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>80</mn><mo>%</mo><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then what is the output current (in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>)?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "40",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2400</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5000</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>240</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p>efficiency,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>%</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>?</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>η</mi><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2400</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mn>240</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p>",
